<title>HUNGARY: DUNAHOLDING '96 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF934MLN.</title>
<headline>DUNAHOLDING '96 PRE-TAX PROFIT HUF934MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated.)</p>
<p>								1996</p>
<p>    Operating result				    239.8 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result					934.0</p>
<p>    Net sales						99.5</p>
<p>    Other revenues					136.6</p>
<p>    Direct costs on sales			     217.3</p>
<p>    Indirects costs on sales			  101.3</p>
<p>    Other expenditures				  157.5</p>
<p>    Financial result				  1,344.5</p>
<p>     Revenues from financial activities	 1,633.1</p>
<p>     Expenditures on financial activities	 288.6</p>
<p>    Extraordinary result				170.7 loss</p>
<p>NOTE: The figures are unaudited. Comparative 1995 figures</p>
<p>were not immediately available. Dunaholding Rt is a financial</p>
<p>consultant, investment and holding company.</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
